        {
            "title": "美股｜美股成交榜：Lichen International居首 英偉達排第二",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"美股｜美股成交榜：Lichen International居首 英偉達排第二\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"502\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e6cd3d35aab14a9b84d896addee28a7e5bc9c3f7f11e8c3427e591e579b8360d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">美股｜美股成交榜：Lichen International居首 英偉達排第二</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美股11月18日最活躍股份名單顯示，Lichen International Ltd.以284,792,129股成交居首，收報0.0167美元，跌0.0053美元。英偉達以101,657,457股排第二，收報154.66美元，跌0.80美元。大型科技股個別發展，AMD及Broadcom上升，UnitedHealth則明顯下跌。</p></div>",
